  "title": "Qt: Fix FunnelConsoleAction UB",
  "description": "FunnelConsoleAction is a QAction, which means that its parent is a\nQObject (the mainApp). The IOConsoleDialog is a QDialog, which means\nthat its parent has to be a QWidget. qobject_cast'ing a QObject* to\na QWidget* can produce a null pointer. Binding by reference to a\nnull pointer is UB:\n\n/home/johnthacker/git/wireshark/ui/qt/funnel_statistics.cpp:232:39: runtime error: reference binding to null pointer of type 'QWidget'\nSUMMARY: UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer: undefined-behavior /home/johnthacker/git/wireshark/ui/qt/funnel_statistics.cpp:232:39\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
